"\n"
"12.0.2.0.0 (2019-05-28)\n"
"-----------------------\n"
"\n"
"New features:\n"
"\n"
"- Pass parameters as functions.\n"
"- Add Systray.\n"
"\n"
"12.0.1.0.0 (2019-02-18)\n"
"-----------------------\n"
"\n"
"Migrated to Odoo 12.\n"
"\n"
"11.0.1.0.0 (2018-05-09)\n"
